# Reference

**Prerequisites:** none beyond the [docs prerequisites](/docs/start/prerequisites/).
**Kind:** reference landing.
**Status:** development `main`.

Each contract has one owner. Tutorials and how-tos summarize and link here.

- [Language](/docs/reference/language/) — `.rocci` syntax
- [Runtime and HTTP](/docs/reference/runtime/) — handler responses and lifecycle
- [CLI](/docs/reference/cli/) — `rocci` commands only
- [Configuration](/docs/reference/configuration/) — `rocci.toml`
- [Compatibility](/docs/reference/compatibility/) — platforms and toolchains
- [Diagnostics](/docs/reference/diagnostics/) — failure phases and messages
- [Status](/docs/status/) — experimental labels and known limits
- [Contributor tree appendix](/docs/reference/contributor/rocci-tree/) — AST inspect tags
- [Contributor checklist](/docs/reference/contributor/checklist/) — local CI path for docs PRs
- [First-use protocol](/docs/reference/contributor/first-use/) — newcomer sessions and search queries

Task recipes: [How to](/docs/how-to/). Mental models: [compilation](/docs/concepts/compilation-model/).
Terms: [Glossary](/docs/glossary/).

Rocdown language, site config, and `rocdown` CLI live on the [Rocdown product lane](/rocdown/).
